{'symbol': 'MKTX', 'date': '2022-02-28 16:15:00', 'title': 'MARKETAXESS TO PARTICIPATE IN THE 43RD ANNUAL RAYMOND JAMES INSTITUTIONAL INVESTORS CONFERENCE', 'text': 'NEW YORK, FEB. 28, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- MARKETAXESS HOLDINGS INC. (NASDAQ: MKTX), THE OPERATOR OF A LEADING ELECTRONIC TRADING PLATFORM FOR FIXED-INCOME SECURITIES, AND THE PROVIDER OF MARKET DATA AND POST-TRADE SERVICES FOR THE GLOBAL FIXED-INCOME MARKETS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT RICK MCVEY, CHAIRMAN AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER AND CHRIS GEROSA, CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, WILL PARTICIPATE IN THE 43RD ANNUAL RAYMOND JAMES INSTITUTIONAL INVESTORS CONFERENCE ON MARCH 7, 2022 AT 1:05 P.M. EST.'}